      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对明显是高水平的对手。\n她顶住了最后凶猛追逐，\n竭尽全力取下了漂亮的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "117056e3e9f0b8e306bfb7aa9611c7f8832fcb8bcaee80143a19d805222e55dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
