    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d6c9b35c5bda20cfce8356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――言出必行，正如爱慕织姬发誓那样，\n她将那份屈辱变成了力量从而取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "840208272633c628cbf69613a88df02a88f0bbf6ba7fe71407de58148e9348d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
