      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而明天――是出战重赏比赛的日子。\n对于她来说是天大的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "090b75c6977eb4b2f8d43e2a7be0efe061cc4c54ae4b40c0d589c89fe0076bac",
